        "slc_6436e99ecd50f5c882151cb2ebee0470d1daf7d6d488148fb4b4466cb2b1d148"
      ],
      "text": "Reported repository-level code generation result is 53.3% Pass@5 on RepoExec-Python, and 249 bugs fixed on Defects4J-Java for fault localization and repair."
    },
    {
