        "slc_93e0efc5158478f02a96d9d1e9a31a5ef42ba9d76b762e4e4efc45e9b84050c1"
      ],
      "text": "Installation requires a conda environment named 'hyperagent' with Python 3.10, because the Executor uses a jupyter kernel of that name; the pinned requirements include anthropic, docker, GitPython, and e2b packages."
    },
    {
