        "slc_ef8e14a1a40595ec9f8a76b78282ff86a2316512497400a2ac913741ee89c34e"
      ],
      "text": "A Python API exposes HyperAgent(repo, commit, language, clone_dir, config) for use, and a CLI via main.py accepts repo path, commit hash, language, clone dir, and a free-form prompt."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e5a719fa3fa0bcf85e985621ff77e441090a3c4dc5c1fcf828e995eb72fc4806",
