          "line_end": 78,
          "line_start": 78,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "fsoft-ai4code/hyperagent",
          "url": "https://github.com/FSoft-AI4Code/HyperAgent/blob/c3092f2601ab3bf7f890fac2cd5b1290d3f59256/README.md#L78-L78"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b8b0285e668c0777068142387339fa51b629cb2d3f2eceb311601ed92822b0fd"
      ],
      "text": "HyperAgent supports two modes: patch mode generates a patch for a task, and predict mode predicts the next token (e.g., for repoQA or fault location)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3583f0bab1f1da9c69758a7f5a1c737fe396a5711ae11a14173817037a38aaee",
