      ],
      "text": "Tasks are implemented as task classes with a run(system, idx) method that constructs a prompt, calls system.query_codebase, and returns a result; example scripts live in the scripts folder and src/hyperagent/tasks."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_723a24201ae3daec8ee92d9dc3ac62fe7b9f08c3e32ddb0f5748b8f0419c5bc9",
